  "scope": "Accepts all 135 fully visible SQL74 aggregate fields and fifteen PASS rows. Ten TOP_CATEGORY rows are ordered by eligible-pair volume, with numeric-ID tie-break, followed by OTHER_MAPPED, three retained unknown buckets and TOTAL. Non-total counts reconcile to 2,042,310 eligible pairs, 43,147 cart pairs and 15,520 transaction pairs; total percentages are 2.1127%, 0.7599% and 35.9701%. Mapped and unknown eligible counts reconcile to SQL73. Category is fixed at first observed view and both later stages remain within the same inclusive seven-day deadline with strict stage order. Rates use row-local denominators and are not additive; the zero UNKNOWN_REFERENCE bucket has three genuine NULL rates. Top selection is by volume rather than best/worst conversion; OTHER_MAPPED is a heterogeneous aggregate. Published category codes are anonymous grouped labels, not inferred business names or raw visitor/item/transaction identifiers. Unknown buckets describe the analysis history, not proof of missing customer-facing website categories. Segment differences remain descriptive, not causal, person/order/session outcomes or inventory effects. Screenshot evidence is distinct from direct database inspection; unqueried availability/UTC fields, full production fact, hierarchy and learner conceptual understanding are not reverified. Historical pending statements remain unchanged, with current acceptance appended."
